  "description": "What the DHG registry has captured: deferred items, decisions, insights, corrections, bug fixes, ship and agent sessions, test coverage. Read through the read-only role grafana_ro (SELECT only, statement_timeout 10s). Default range is 30 days because capture events are sparse \u2014 a 6h window is legitimately empty. No panel touches incident_actions or incident_events (2.6M rows each, no usable time index); the single incidents tile is a raw count, labelled as such."
